<title>USA: Dlr creeps above US lows vs yen, near flat vs mark.</title>
<headline>Dlr creeps above US lows vs yen, near flat vs mark.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Dlr simmers at open level vs mark, creeps above 111 yen.</p>
<p>*Dlr/yen targets 110 near-term, below support at 110.75-50.</p>
<p>*Waigel says emergency ECOFIN mtg Sunday in Amsterdam possible</p>
<p>*Talk from European leaders optimistic over EU stability pact.</p>
<p>*Dlr hurt earlier after Tsy's Summers said Japan should avoid</p>
<p>running up external surpluses that would hurt global growth.</p>
</text>
